    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/8/8c/Hanzo_Hattori_QBULB_%C3%97_Hyakka_Ryouran_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20240625231807\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Hanzo Hattori QBULB × Hyakka Ryouran \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/8/8c/Hanzo_Hattori_QBULB_%C3%97_Hyakka_Ryouran_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20240625231807\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"1070\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Hanzo Hattori QBULB × Hyakka Ryouran .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Hanzo_Hattori_QBULB_%C3%97_Hyakka_Ryouran_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</p><p><b>暗影大师武士</b>\n</p><p><b>服部半藏</b>  是来自系列的角色。\n\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hyakka_Ry%C5%8Dran_Samurai_Girls\">百花缭乱：武士女孩</a>\n</p><p><b>服部半藏</b>  是  <a href=\"/wiki/Tokugawa_Sen\" title=\"Tokugawa Sen\">德川千</a>的忍者仆人，也是学生会风纪委员长。她总是穿着女仆装，戴着眼镜。她的武器是一根双刃长杆，可以分成两把独立的武士刀，但她也能从裙下射出手里剑之类的武器。她的眼镜还赋予她特殊技能，比如探测他人力量水平的能力。\n\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearance\">外观</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FHattori_Hanzo%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>半藏是一位非常美丽的年轻女性。她有一头银色的长发，扎成马尾辫。她总是穿着女仆装，戴着一副眼镜。她穿着白色及膝袜，右腿穿灰色紧身裤，脚穿一双黑红色厚底凉鞋，鞋底有细圆柱形，所以看起来像踩在两根棍子上。\n\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Personality\">性格</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FHattori_Hanzo%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>半藏是一个非常忠诚的人，总是在需要时准备为朋友而战。她也善良，关心周围每个人，但她也无畏且坚强。小时候，半藏非常害羞，还有点笨拙，但当千在学校被孩子们欺负时，半藏总是保护公主。这给了她变强的动力，以便她能一直保护公主。她也有点受虐倾向。\n\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/9/9a/FB_IMG_1741875296717.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20250313141800\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"FB IMG 1741875296717\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"720\" height=\"1600\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"FB IMG 1741875296717.jpg\" data-image-key=\"FB_IMG_1741875296717.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/9/9a/FB_IMG_1741875296717.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20250313141800\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\"Powers_.26_Abilities\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Powers_&amp;_Abilities\">力量与能力</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FHattori_Hanzo%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>她后来成为宗朗的第七位大师武士。在大师武士状态下，她用全息显示器代替眼镜来探测对手的力量水平和他们的气水平。她的武器是背上的巨大卷轴，可以分裂成各种三面手里剑。\n\n</p>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"f6bfd105b5c889820f97e00c72f3aad6\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Hanzo_Hattori_Shadow_Master_Samurai_S_QBULB_--_Hyakka_Ryouran_-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:74px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Hanzo_Hattori_Shadow_Master_Samurai_S_QBULB_%C3%97_Hyakka_Ryouran_.jpg\" title=\"Hanzo Hattori Shadow Master Samurai S QBULB × Hyakka Ryouran .jpg (288 KB)\" style=\"height:185px; width:74px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/4/46/Hanzo_Hattori_Shadow_Master_Samurai_S_QBULB_%C3%97_Hyakka_Ryouran_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20250321215812\" title=\"Hanzo Hattori Shadow Master Samurai S QBULB × Hyakka Ryouran .jpg (288 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Hanzo Hattori Shadow Master Samurai S QBULB × Hyakka Ryouran .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Hanzo_Hattori_Shadow_Master_Samurai_S_QBULB_%C3%97_Hyakka_Ryouran_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Hanzo Hattori Shadow Master Samurai S QBULB × Hyakka Ryouran .jpg (288 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Hanzo Hattori Shadow Master Samurai S QBULB × Hyakka Ryouran .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Hanzo_Hattori_Shadow_Master_Samurai_S_QBULB_%C3%97_Hyakka_Ryouran_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/4/46/Hanzo_Hattori_Shadow_Master_Samurai_S_QBULB_%C3%97_Hyakka_Ryouran_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20250321215812\" /></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Hanzo_Hattori_Shadow_Master_Samurai_QBULB_--_Hyakka_Ryouran_Samurai_Bride_-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:184px; width:73px; top:0.5px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Hanzo_Hattori_Shadow_Master_Samurai_QBULB_%C3%97_Hyakka_Ryouran_Samurai_Bride_.jpg\" title=\"Hanzo Hattori Shadow Master Samurai QBULB × Hyakka Ryouran Samurai Bride .jpg (285 KB)\" style=\"height:184px; width:73px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/7/77/Hanzo_Hattori_Shadow_Master_Samurai_QBULB_%C3%97_Hyakka_Ryouran_Samurai_Bride_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20250321215813\" title=\"Hanzo Hattori Shadow Master Samurai QBULB × Hyakka Ryouran Samurai Bride .jpg (285 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Hanzo Hattori Shadow Master Samurai QBULB × Hyakka Ryouran Samurai Bride .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Hanzo_Hattori_Shadow_Master_Samurai_QBULB_%C3%97_Hyakka_Ryouran_Samurai_Bride_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Hanzo Hattori Shadow Master Samurai QBULB × Hyakka Ryouran Samurai Bride .jpg (285 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Hanzo Hattori Shadow Master Samurai QBULB × Hyakka Ryouran Samurai Bride .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Hanzo_Hattori_Shadow_Master_Samurai_QBULB_%C3%97_Hyakka_Ryouran_Samurai_Bride_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/7/77/Hanzo_Hattori_Shadow_Master_Samurai_QBULB_%C3%97_Hyakka_Ryouran_Samurai_Bride_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20250321215813\" /></a></div></div></div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260820041037\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.009 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.016 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 14/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3882/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_queensblade:pcache:idhash:39722-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260820041037 and revision id 64032. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"
